# ---- Book Five ----
("**Forty steps. Six phases. Twelve months. Nothing skipped.**",
 "**Thirty-three steps. Four phases. About twelve months. Nothing skipped.**"),
("**That is not evidence it isn't working. That is evidence something is trying to get its house back.** Write it down when it happens — naming the pattern removes the fear of it.",
 "**That is not proof it is failing, and it is not proof it is working — it is proof you have touched something real.** Sleep, eat, stay near your people, and tell your counselor or one safe person. Not every hard day is a spiritual attack, and you do not have to decide what caused it before you ask for help. Write it down when it happens — naming it makes it easier to face."),
("Identify where he's working on you **this week.**", "Notice which pattern is loudest **this week.**"),
("## PHASE 2 — LEGAL ACTION (Steps 8–17)", "## PHASE 2 — PRAYING IT THROUGH (Steps 8–17)"),
("**Do these with one trusted believer present if at all possible. Out loud always. Specific always — \"anything and everything\" is not how legal action works.**",
 "**A note before Phase 2:** these are prayers, not a formula. Scripture invites us to confess, forgive, and resist the devil (James 4:7; 5:16), but it does not hand us a script, and nothing here replaces a doctor, a counselor, or a pastor who knows you. You may skip any step that stirs up more than you can hold. Do these with one trusted believer present if you can. Out loud helps. Specific helps — \"anything and everything\" is hard to mean."),
("**This will not feel true the first time. Do it anyway. Feeling follows obedience — sometimes by months.**",
 "**This will not feel true the first time. Do it anyway. Feeling follows obedience — sometimes by months. And forgiving is not the same as trusting them again or letting them back in.**"),
("### STEP 15 — CUT EVERY SOUL TIE", "### STEP 15 — RELEASE EVERY HOLD (\"SOUL TIES\")"),
("> \"In the name of Jesus Christ I sever every ungodly soul tie between me and [name]. I return to them",
 "> \"In the name of Jesus Christ I release my hold on [name] and ask You to loosen every unhealthy bond between us. I return to them"),
("### STEP 17 — COMMAND IT OUT AND SEAL THE DOORS", "### STEP 17 — RESIST AND SEAL THE DOORS (OPTIONAL)"),
("Now — and only now, after everything above — you evict. **You do this last on purpose. You do not evict a tenant while the lease is still valid. Steps 8–16 tore up the lease. Now there's no legal ground, and this part is enforcement, not a fight.**",
 "This step is optional. If you believe something spiritual has been pressing on you, talk it over with a pastor or counselor you trust first, and skip it if it stirs up more than you can hold. Scripture's instruction is simple: submit to God, resist the devil, and he will flee (James 4:7)."),
("> \"Every spirit that entered through any door I have named — through trauma, through vow, through contract, through my bloodline, through what was done to me and what I did — hear me. Your legal ground is gone. It was revoked by the blood of Jesus Christ and by my agreement with God.\n>\n> I am not your house. I am bought, sealed, and occupied by the Holy Spirit.\n>\n> In the name of Jesus Christ: leave. Now. Go where He sends you. You may not transfer to my children, my family, my home, or anyone in this house. You may not return. Go.\"",
 "> \"Jesus, I belong to You. Anything that is not from You — any lie, fear, or influence that took hold through what I have named — has no place in my life, my home, or my family. In Your name I resist it, and I ask You to send it away. I am not its house. I am bought, sealed, and occupied by the Holy Spirit. Stay with me. Amen.\""),
("Naming the pushback in advance kills its power.**",
 "Naming what comes up makes it easier to face.**"),
("### Luke 11:24–26. An empty house gets reoccupied, worse. **Do not skip this phase. This is where most people lose everything they just won.**",
 "### Luke 11:24–26 is Jesus' picture of a swept house left empty. **Do not skip this phase — when something leaves your life, something good has to move in.**"),
("**Isolation is Stage 4 of the enemy's plan for a reason — it's the one that makes all the others work.**",
 "**Isolation makes almost every other harm worse, and being known by safe people is one of the strongest protections there is.**"),
("**That is not failure. That's an enemy running a known play.**",
 "**That is not failure. It's a familiar pull, and you can meet it with a plan.**"),
("Secrecy is the enemy's whole oxygen supply.", "Secrecy keeps shame alive."),

